From d5ae14bc861dba4c0124789c749a7fed9c5949a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:28:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add bounded V2 VM scan decode and execution core

Review integration note (2026-10-14; newly recorded explanation):
Add an isolated P03 instruction-boundary scanner, structured decoder and bounded execution core. Assigned but unsupported operations fail explicitly. This stage does not wire daemon consensus or charge P05 costs; later patches in this series add context and static accounting.

